            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.1.1</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Copied, exported, and saved transcripts now share consistent formatting with titles, speaker labels, and timestamps.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Live transcripts appear sooner during uninterrupted speech.</li>
  <li>Reduced repeated text during dictation when numbers, dates, or amounts are revised as you speak.</li>
  <li>Renaming a recording now updates the title in its saved transcript file.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
